    "compose_patient": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.0",
          "heading": "why_in_hospital",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.0",
            "sections.1"
          ],
          "text": "You were found on the floor by your son after a fall. You had gone to the commode. You were not sure how long you had been on the floor.\n\nThe team found:\n- A short run of an abnormal heart rhythm (atrial flutter) on a heart tracing\n- A possible chest infection (possible aspiration pneumonia)\n- An area of infection or inflammation in the lower right part of your lung\n- Inflammation of part of your bowel (sigmoid diverticulitis)\n- Some bowel loops that looked stretched, which may point to a blockage, and a build-up of stool\n- A temporary drop in how well your kidneys were working\n- Raised markers of infection in your blood\n\nYou also have a number of long-term conditions, including high blood pressure (hypertension), heart disease (ischaemic heart disease), long-term kidney disease (chronic kidney disease), a broken rib, a broken hip (fracture of neck of femur), overactive parathyroid glands (hyperparathyroidism), and cervical cancer (carcinoma of cervix). You were recently in the coronary care unit after a heart attack (NSTEMI) and are on heart medicines from that stay. The team also noted that you may have an underlying memory condition."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.1",
          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "Tests done in hospital included:\n- A heart tracing (ECG)\n- Blood tests, including blood cultures\n- A urine culture\n- Scans of your head, neck, chest, and abdomen\n- A chest X-ray\n- An abdominal X-ray\n\nTreatment included:\n- You were treated as having a serious infection (sepsis)\n- An antibiotic (Tazocin) was given through a drip\n- Fluids were given through a drip\n- Oxygen was given\n- An amber care plan was started"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.2",
          "heading": "medicines",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{MEDICATIONS}}"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.3",
          "heading": "next_steps",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.7"
          ],
          "text": "A referral to a memory clinic has been advised. This is because the team thinks you may have an underlying memory condition. This will be as an outpatient."
        },
